  "description": "Züs (formerly 0Chain) is a decentralized blockchain-based storage platform with no vendor lock-in and a 3-layer security - fragmentation, proxy re-encryption, and immutability. It has close to wire speed data performance, free reads, and is ideal for apps as well as backups, AI data, disaster recovery.",
